    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SquareMan-Boy</strong> is a fast paced action platformer with focus on quick and precise movement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're always in motion, bounced between color-coded blocks, dodging lasers, and racing to the exit. Use your charge dash, world rotators, and teleporters to bend each level to your will. Every second counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each level has an exit and your goal is to reach it without dying</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/e7b00a7cc139da3e5cab17dc216c4377.poster.avif?t=1754040550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/e7b00a7cc139da3e5cab17dc216c4377.webm?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/e7b00a7cc139da3e5cab17dc216c4377.mp4?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Press and hold to charge a dash, release the button to charge away with great speed</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/73c6b9fd5dbba8d5af7917efe759b1d1.poster.avif?t=1754040550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/73c6b9fd5dbba8d5af7917efe759b1d1.webm?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/73c6b9fd5dbba8d5af7917efe759b1d1.mp4?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World rotators will always rotate the level 90 degrees clockwise</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/63e3317811b0b1b3951d6ae1099a775a.poster.avif?t=1754040550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/63e3317811b0b1b3951d6ae1099a775a.webm?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/63e3317811b0b1b3951d6ae1099a775a.mp4?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teleporters will let you travel unharmed to its same colored twin</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/40a802974700eff48451de737792536a.poster.avif?t=1754040550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/40a802974700eff48451de737792536a.webm?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/40a802974700eff48451de737792536a.mp4?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/4f8955431eddfb758c8929d640a50306.poster.webp?t=1754040550\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/4f8955431eddfb758c8929d640a50306.webp?t=1754040550\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards for quickest times on each level</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global or between steam friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast paced action with responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100+ handcrafted levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large amount of bite-sized levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Neon style graphics and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synthwave sounds track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/99e0e10c538e6027b379d6a91f9b269f.avif?t=1754040550\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/f535d2a75cce241d4a40f2be8ff5d105.poster.avif?t=1754040550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/f535d2a75cce241d4a40f2be8ff5d105.webm?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/f535d2a75cce241d4a40f2be8ff5d105.mp4?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/35c9286e5cf2c24a238bf7d26a86141b.avif?t=17540