ore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards for quickest times on each level</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global or between steam friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast paced action with responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100+ handcrafted levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large amount of bite-sized levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Neon style graphics and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synthwave sounds track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/99e0e10c538e6027b379d6a91f9b269f.avif?t=1754040550\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/f535d2a75cce241d4a40f2be8ff5d105.poster.avif?t=1754040550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/f535d2a75cce241d4a40f2be8ff5d105.webm?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/f535d2a75cce241d4a40f2be8ff5d105.mp4?t=1754040550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639710/extras/35c9286e5cf2c24a238bf7d26a86141b.avif?t=1754040550\